================================================================================
OPEN-WEIGHT AI & DIGITALOCEAN GENAI ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
================================================================================
This open-source project utilizes open-weight Large Language Models (including
Meta Llama 3.3 70B Instruct / Mistral / Qwen open-weight models) served via the
DigitalOcean GenAI Platform (OpenAI-compatible inference API) wrapped inside an
original, open-source Cyber Threat Intelligence Verification & Grounding Harness:
  1. Stage 1 (Deterministic Grounding): Regex IOC refanging, extraction, and
     bipartite NetworkX graph correlation (`cyber-threat-ai/analyzer.py`).
  2. Stage 2 (Constrained Open-Weight Inference): Schema-constrained prompting
     with strict indicator allow-lists on DigitalOcean GenAI (`cyber-threat-ai/ai_engine.py`).
  3. Stage 3 (Hallucination Guardrail & Deterministic Fallback): Automated
     post-generation IOC verification (`validate_ai_output`) and offline MITRE
     ATT&CK rule-based fallback scoring.
